  "_comment": [
    "Authored puzzle content, ported from the RAW table in design/Squarebuzz.dc.html.",
    "Grids use '#' for a filled cell and '.' for an empty one, one string per row, so a",
    "puzzle can be read and edited by eye in a diff. Row/column clues are never stored -",
    "they are derived by ClueCalculator, which keeps them impossible to desynchronise",
    "from the solution.",
    "Sizes 15/20/25 have no authored content and are produced by the generator instead."
  ],

